<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc1">TIMOTEO NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NYƆ</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NYƆ</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul hworɔle krataa he mane Timoteo ne, ne ɔla prizin wɔ Roman kɔyɛ afoɛ 65 Y.A,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> na ne waha kaa maa bɛku ye. Paul hane ye pen hyirele Timoteo kyɛ, sɛ oyia ɔtaeɛ po a, ɔhɔ so ha nzɛmba ne. Edwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ nwomaa he anu ne de, né ɔkɔ ma Timoteo tee, ɔte krataa bɔ ɔpɛ yebo bɔ Paul tworɔ mane ye mmango bɔ ɔne ye yɛ adwuma, na osa te ye damvo ne. Paul hyɛle Timoteo nguraen kyɛ ɔhɔ so li nahorɛ, na ɔmaa onwuni ye kyɛ ye bɔbɔ wafa ye asetena wayɛ nneasoɛ wama ye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mmerɛ bɔ Paul tworɔ krataa he ne, né mmeni pee aye ye nu, na ne ebiemɔ koso kwaayɛ asɛnka adwuma ne wɔ nekaa foforɛ. Sɔ mmerɛ ne, Timoteo suban pa, ne kyɛbɔ ne ɔye ye kunu boka ye nati, ne wafe ye paa. Ne Paul se kyɛ ɔngɔhyɛ biala, ne bahu ye, ɛhene ati yeɛ ɔhworɔle edwirɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo mane Timoteo ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul ha hyirele ye kyɛ, ogyina pindinn wɔ gyidie nanu, na ɔsrɛle ye kyɛ ɔɔsra ye kora ne bahu ye. Ɔwɔ nu, ɔngɔhyɛ ne bahu Paul, nakoso ɔha hyirele Timoteo kyɛ, ɔba a ɔfa nwomaa bɔ babobɔ nemɔ bra, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkɔhɔ so bekosua nikye, na bahworɔ ngrataa.</para>
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Timoteo gyidie ti, Paul lale Nyameɛ ase (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-5">1:3-5</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul hyɛ Timoteo ngunaen kyɛ ɔhɔ so li nahorɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:6-2:13">1:6–2:13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mmenia suban wɔ awieɛ mmerɛ nanu ne; awaefoɛ nemɔ awa dada (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:1-13">3:1-13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul nguraenhyɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:14-4:5">3:14–4:5</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tebea bɔ Paul wɔ nu wɔ prizin (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:6-18">4:6-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:19-22">4:19-22</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Paul, bɔ Nyameɛ adaworoma nde Yesu Kristo akoaa, kyɛbɔ ngoa nwo bɔhyɛ bɔ ɔnate Kristo Yesu so ne te ne,<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />mefa krataa he mekɔma mma Timoteo bɔ medɔ ye ne:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Adom, anwunvoin, ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ ne y'Awurade Yesu Kristo berɛ ha wɔ.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Meda Nyameɛ bɔ mefa ahonim pa me so ye, kyɛbɔ me baba mɔ yɛle ne ase paa. Na daa biala mekaye wɔ wɔ me mbaeɛ nu eyia ne kɔngɔen. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Sɛ mekaye ɛmoen bɔ ɛtele ne a, ɛyɛ a né mafe wɔ, na mepena kyɛ menwu wɔ, ná wamaa me nye agye. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Ofikyɛ mekaye gyidie bɔ nyaatwom nne nu bɔ ne ɔwɔ wɔ nana Lois ne wɔ maame Yunise nu ne, na medɛ́ medi kyɛ sɔ gyidie ne bie wɔ wɔ nu. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Yeti mekaye wɔ kyɛ, Nyameɛ akyɛdeɛ bɔ mvale me sa nguale wɔ so maa enyane ye ne, ma ɔsɔ te kyɛ see. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ amma yɛ esuronyi honhom, mmom honhom bɔ ɔfa mane yɛ ne maa yɛnya tumi, ɔdɔ, ne adwene bɔ enu la berɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Yeti, adanzeɛ bɔ edi fa Awurade nwo ne, nnɛfɛle ye nwo; na me, bɔ Kristo ti nna prizin ne koso, nnɛfɛle me nwo. Mmom fa wɔ nwo to Nyameɛ tumi so, na nwu nzɛmba nanwo amaneɛ ne bie. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Ye yeɛ olɛle yɛ, na wafrɛ yɛ kyɛ yɛɛyɛ akrongronfoɛ, nná yɛ nyumaa pa ti yeɛ ɔfrɛle yɛ ɔ, mmom ye bɔbɔ ye atirimbɔ ne ye adom ti ɔ. Sɔ adom ne yeɛ wafa walo yɛ wɔ Yesu Kristo nu fi teteete ne. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Nakoso kesaalae de, wamaa yanwu sɔ adom ne pefee, nate y'Agyenkwa, Kristo Yesu bɔ wala ye ali naso. Ye yeɛ ɔnate nzɛmba naso aye ewue afi berɛ, na wamaa yanwu kyɛbɔ yekonya ngoa ne bɔ ɔmborɔ ne. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Sɔ nzɛmba nati yeɛ bɛyele me kyɛ ebie bɔ ɔka nzɛmba, somafoɛ, ne kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ menwu amaneɛ sɔ ne, nakoso menvɛle. Ofikyɛ mese bɔ medɛ́ Ye medi ne, na mese kyɛ bɔ mafa mawura ye sa ne,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Wafa wawura me sa ne.”</char></note> ɔkɔbɔ ye nwo waen koodwu sɔ kyẽa ne. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Edwirɛ pa bɔ ɛte fili me berɛ ne, kɔ so fa gyidie ne ɔdɔ bɔ ele ye wɔ Kristo Yesu nu ne tira nu yé. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Nikye pa bɔ bafa bawura wɔ sa ne, sɔ nu yé nate honhom krongron bɔ ɔwɔ yɛ nu naso.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Ɛse kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Asia mandanu wa namukoraati aye me nu, Figelo ne Hermogene po boka sɔ mmenia naso. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Awurade nwu Onesiforo awurofoɛ anwunvo, ofikyɛ bɛmaa me nwo tɔle me paa, na banvɛle kyenyi bɔ bafa bakyekye me nanwo. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, oodwuli Roman ne, ɔpenane me tonn oodwuli kyɛ onwuni me ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Mesrɛ Nyameɛ <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa Awurade.</char></note> kyɛ, ɔma Awurade nwu ye anwunvo sɔ kyẽa ne. Na wɔ koso, ɛse bɔ ɔyɛ mane me wɔ Efeso namukoraati.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Yeti mma, yɛ se wɔ adom bɔ ɔwɔ Yesu Kristo nu nanu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Na bɔ ɛte fili me berɛ, bɔ mmeni pee di ye nwo adanzeɛ ne, fa wura bɛ bɔ bɛdi nahorɛ ne sa, na wamaa bɛ koso bahora bahyire afoforɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Na wɔ koso, nwu amaneɛ kyɛ Yesu Kristo sogyaniɛ pa. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Sogyaniɛ biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔfa ye nwo wuro-wura wiase nanu ɔ, ofikyɛ ɔpena kyɛ ɔsɔ bɔ ɔfale ye adwuma ne nye. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Afei koso, sɛ ebie si akan<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Tu mirika”</char></note> a, kora bɔ bɛkɔfa abotire ne bɛkɔma ye ne, sana odi ye nwo mmeraa naso. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Kuaniɛ bɔ ɔyɛ adwuma ne, ye yeɛ odikyɛ odi moa di ɛboo nanu aleɛ ne bie ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Kɔ so dwene bɔ meka nanwo, na Awurade kɔmaa ɛkɔte nikye biala bo.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Kaye kyɛ, bɛtingyele Yesu Kristo bɛfili ewue nu, na ɔte David bosoniɛ, sɔ nzɛmba ne yeɛ meka ne, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />ɛhe ati yeɛ menwu amaneɛ, ná bafa me bato prizin kyɛ ebie bɔ wali bɔne ne. Nakoso, Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne de, bɛbbɔle ye panwu.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛkyekyelle ye”</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Bɛ bɔ baye bɛ nati yeɛ memia me nye menwu amaneɛ he amukoraati ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛ koso bekonya daa ngoa wɔ Yesu Kristo nu, na banya ye nwo anuonyam bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa ne koso. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Sɔ dwirɛ he te nahorɛ paa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Sɛ ɔte nahorɛ kyɛ yɛne ye wuli a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">yɛne ye yeɛ yɛkɔtena ase ɔ;<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />sɛ yɛmia yɛ nye yɛgyina nu a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">yɛne ye koli bia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">na sɛ yɛka kyɛ yɛnze ye a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">ye koso, ɔkɔha kyɛ ɔnze yɛ;<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />sɛ yanni nahorɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">ye de, odi nahorɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">ofikyɛ ye de, ɔngora mbo ye nwo.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Kɔ so kaye bɛ sɔ dwirɛ hemɔ, na kyirekyire bɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu kyɛ, nnɛmaa besu edwirɛ nwo aporowaa, ofikyɛ mvasoɛ nne so, na ɔsɛkye bɛbɔ betie ne adwene. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Yɛ bɔ ɛkɔhora biala ma Nyameɛ nwu wɔ kyɛ ebie bɔ ɔfata, ebie bɔ ɔmvɛle ye adwuma nwo, na otira nahorɛ dwirɛ nanu pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Nakoso, twe wɔ nwo fi edwirɛ bɔ ye nwo nhia, na otia bɔ ɔte krongron nanwo, ofikyɛ sɔ dwirɛ ne fa sona kɔ bɔne pee nu, <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />bɛ dwirɛ ne kɔtrɛ te kyɛ anwonyerɛ tɛɛ. Sɔ mmenia ne biemɔ yeɛ ole Himeneo ne Fileto. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Sɔ mmenia hemɔ ahwe bɛ nwo afi nahorɛ nanwo, na bɛkeka kyɛ awufo tingyelɛ ne awa dadaada, ná bɛfa bɛsɛkye ebiemɔ gyidie. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Ɛhe amukoraati si ne, Nyameɛ fapem ne de, ogyi berɛ pindinn, na ɛhe yeɛ bafa bahyɛ ye nzorɛ ɔ: “Awurade se bɛ bɔ bɛte ye deɛ,” na “Ebiala bɔ ɔbɔ Awurade dumaa ne, ma ɔhwe ye nwo fi nikye biala bɔ ɔndengyɛ nanwo.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Sɛ ɛkɔ awuro piri nu a, ngyɛnzee pee wɔ berɛ, ebie wɔ berɛ a sikaa kɔkorɛ anaa dwetɛ yeɛ bɛfa bɛyɛle ɔ, na ebie koso te mmakaa ne nnɛterɛ. Bɛfa ebie bɛyɛ nikye bɔ ole anuonyam, na bɛfa ebie koso bɛyɛ nikye bɔ olle anuonyam. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Yeti, sɛ ebie twe ye nwo fi nikye biala bɔ olle anuonyam nanwo a, né waayɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛyɛ nikye bɔ ole anuonyam, nikye bɔ bate ye nwo bɔ ye wura fa yɛ nikye a ɔyɛ yé, ná wasiesie ye nwo wama adwuma pa biala.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Yeti, twe wɔ nwo fi mmrandeɛ nu akɔnnɔ nwo, na di tenenee, gyidie, ɔdɔ ne asomdwie si, ɛne bɛbɔ bɛfi ahone bɔ enu te nu bɛfrɛ Awurade ne. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Afei koso, twe wɔ nwo fi ngwasea aporowaa bɔ mvasoɛ biala nne so nanwo, ofikyɛ ɛse kyɛ ngondii yeɛ ɔfa ba ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Nnɛmaa Awurade akoaa kõ, mmom odikyɛ odwo ma ebiala, ɔkora kyirekyire, na ɔhyɛ ye nwo so mmerɛ bɔ ebie ayɛ ye bɔne, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />ná ofi anwobraseɛ nu dwudwo kyire bɛ bɔ bate atua ne. Ebia ne Nyameɛ amaa basakra b'adwene banya nahorɛ nanwo nimdeɛ bɔ odi mu. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Ɛhene kɔmaa bɛ nye kɔwa bɛ nwo so, na bahwe bɛ nwo bafi Abɔnzam ngaen nwo, ofikyɛ bɛkonwu kyɛ wahye bɛ, ná ɔfa bɛ yɛ bɔ okuro ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Nakoso kaye kyɛ, awieɛ mmerɛ nanu ne, mmerɛ bɔ enu yɛ se kɔwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Ofikyɛ mmenia kɔyɛ pɛsɛmengominya, bɛ nye kɔboro sikaa, bɛkɔhoɔhoa bɛ nwo, bɛkɔyɛ ahomasoɛ, bɛkɔkeka mmusue dwirɛ, bɛkɔyɛ b'awofo so asoserɛ, bɛkɔyɛ bonniayɛ, bɛ bɔ benni nahorɛ, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />bɛ bɔ bɛlle tema,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa: “Bɛnnɔ sona”</char></note> bɛ bɔ bɛne bɛ ngora nnyɛ apam, bɛ bɔ bɛsɛkye mmenia dumaa, bɛ bɔ bɛngora bɛnhyɛ bɛ nwo so, anyeserɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛnguro pa, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />bɛ bɔ bɛye bɛ mmango bɛma, bɛ bɔ bɛmmu nikye, mbaninzɛm, bɛ bɔ bɛkuro anigye bɛtra Nyameɛ, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />bɛkɔyɛ bɛ nwo kyɛ bɛsõ Nyameɛ, nakoso bɛngɔyɛ bɔ okuro ɔ. Sɔ mmenia ne, twe wɔ nwo fi bɛ nwo. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Sɔ mmenia nemɔ bie wiewia bɛ nwo kɔ awuro nu, na mmrasua bɔ bɛyɛ mmerɛ, bɛte bɔne nu, na akɔnnɔ ahoroɛ ahyɛ bɛ so ne, bɛfa bɛ bɛyɛ ngoaa. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Bɛsua nikye daa biala, nakoso bɛngora bennya nahorɛ nanwo nimdeɛ bɔ odi mu ne. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Na kyɛbɔ Jannes ne Jambre dwɔso tiale Mose ne, sɔ mmenia hemɔ koso kɔdwɔso kotia nahorɛ ne. Bɛte mmenia bɔ b'adwene asɛkye koraa, na Nyameɛ nnne bɛ ndonu wɔ gyidie nanu. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Nakoso, bɛngɔhora bɛ nyunu kɔ kõ, ofikyɛ bɛ ngwaseasɛm ne kɔla ali maa ebiala konwu ye, kyɛbɔ Jannes ne Jambre deɛ ne yɛle nala.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Nakoso wɔ de, ali me ngyerɛkyerɛ, m'abrabɔ, bɔ ogyi me nye so, me gyidie, m'aboterɛ, me dɔ, ɔne m'animia si pɛɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />Na kyɛbɔ mmenia tane me nye, ɔne amaneɛ bɔ manwu, te kyɛ bɔ ɔtole me wɔ Antiokia, Ikoniom, ne Listra ne, ɛse ye mukoraati. Mmiane me nye ngyinane sɔ haw he amukoraati nu, na Awurade lɛle me fili nu. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛpena kyɛ bɛfa nyamesom pa bɛtena ase wɔ Kristo Yesu nu namukoraati ne de, bɛkɔtane bɛ nye. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Ofikyɛ, amumuyɛfoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛlaka-laka mmenia kɔhɔ bɛ nyunu wɔ bɔne nu, bɛkɔlaka-laka ebiemɔ, na ebiemɔ kɔlaka-laka bɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Nakoso wɔ de, bɔ asua, na alɛ́ ali kyɛ ɔte nahorɛ ne, kɔ so ala tira nu yé, ofikyɛ ɛse bɛ bɔ esua fili bɛ berɛ ne. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Efi wɔ ngwalaa nu yeɛ ɛse tworɔ krongron nanu ɔ, ɛhene yeɛ ɔnate Kristo Yesu nu gyidie so kɔhora kɔmaa ekonwu nyanza kɔhɔ daa ngoa nu ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Tworɔnzɛm namukoraati fi Nyameɛ honhom<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa: “Nwomeɛ”</char></note> nu, na mvasoɛ wɔ so, bɛfa bekyirekyire, bɛtengyɛ-tengyɛ nningyein, ɔtengyɛ yɛ so maa yɛyɛ nikye pa, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a Nyameɛ sona kɔfata, bɔ basiesie ye yé bama adwuma pa biala.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Ngyi Nyameɛ ne Kristo Yesu bɔ okobu ateasefoɛ ne awufo mukoraati atɛn mmerɛ bɔ bala ye ali, ɔne mmerɛ bɔ wawa ye Ahennie nu ne nyunu mehyɛ wɔ kitii kyɛ: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Ka edwirɛ ne, yere wɔ nwo ka ye wɔ mmerɛ pa ne mmerɛ tɛɛ nu, ka mmenia nyunu, tengyɛ bɛ so, na tu bɛ fo, nakoso fa aboterɛ ne ngyerɛkyerɛ yɛ ye mukoraati. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Ofikyɛ mmerɛ bie kɔwa bɔ mmenia nngotie ngyerɛkyerɛ pa ne, mmom bɛkoli b'akɔnnɔ si, na bapena akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ bɔ bɛkɔha edwirɛ bɔ ɔkɔyɛ bɛ so anu fɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Yeti bɛngotie nahorɛ ne kõ, edwirɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛhoaa”</char></note> mmom yeɛ bɛkotie ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Nakoso wɔ de, ma wɔnye la berɛ wɔ nikye biala nu, mia wɔnye nwu amaneɛ, yɛ asɛnka adwuma ne, yɛ wɔ som adwuma ne pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Ofikyɛ kesaalae de, bɛhwie me kyɛ nzãa afɔleɛ, na ɔngɔhyɛ né manya me nwo matete. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Maho koɛ pa ne, matu mirika ne mayie, masɔ gyidie nanu. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Afei de, bɔ ɔla berɛ onwondɛ me yeɛ ole tenenee abotire, bɔ Awurade, temmufoɛ bɔ obu atɛn tenenee ne kɔfa kɔma me kyɛ akatua sɔ kyẽa ne, nná me ngome, mmom bɛ bɔ bɛnea atee paa kyɛ bɛkɔla ye ali namukoraati.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Bɔ mmɔden bra me nwo wa ndɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Ofikyɛ wiase nanwo dɔ ti, Dema ayakyi me berɛ ahɔ Tɛsalonika, Kreske ahɔ Galatia, yeɛ Tito ahɔ Dalmatia. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka ngome yeɛ ɔwɔ me nwo wa ɔ, ɛne Marko bra, ofikyɛ ɔboka me paa wɔ asɛnka adwuma nanu. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Tikiko koso, masoma ye kyɛ ɔhɔ Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Sɛ́ ɛba a, fa m'atadeɛ bɔ mefa mekõ ayirɛ ne berɛ me, nyakyile ye wɔ Karpo berɛ wɔ Troa, na fa nwomaa bɔ babobo ne koso bra, ye titire ne, ngaka nwomaa deɛ ne. <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alɛzanda bɔ ɔyɛ kɔɔbere nwo adwuma ne ayɛ me bɔne paa. Awurade kotua ye kerɛ kyɛbɔ ye nneyɛɛ te ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Wɔ koso, ɛyɛ a nea wɔ nwo ye wɔ ye nwo, ofikyɛ odwɔso tiale edwirɛ bɔ yɛka ne paa. <verse eid="2TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Mmerɛ bɔ oli moa bɔ ngɔle kɔɔto kyɛ mekwaaye me nwo noa ne, ebiala amma angyina me si, bɛ mukoraati bɛyakyile me nu. Nnɛmaa bɛfa ye nwo asodi bɛto bɛ so. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Ofikyɛ Awurade gyinane me si mane me anwoserɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔkɔfa me so kɔyɛ ɔsom adwuma ne pɛpɛɛpɛ, na wamaa maen-maen namukoraati ate edwirɛ ne. Yeti olɛle me fili gyata noa nu. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Awurade kole me kofi nikye tɛɛ biala nu, na ɔkɔfa me kɔhɔ Ye anwuro Ahennie nanu. Anuonyam ha ye daa, daa. Amen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Kyea Prisila ne Akwila, ne Onesiforo awurofoɛ ma me.<verse eid="2TI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erasto hale Korinto, na né Trofimo afokyɛ, yeti nyakyile ye wɔ Mileto.<verse eid="2TI 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Bɔ mmɔden kyɛ ɛkɔwa koodwu wa kora ne ayirɛ ne awa. Eubulo nwa ɔkyea wɔ, yeɛ Pude, Lino, Klaudia ne aliemaa mɔ mukoraati koso nwa bɛkyea wɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Awurade boka wɔ so wɔ suban pa bɔ ɛda ye ali nanwo. Ye adom ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>